        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Held by a Pokémon that is not fully evolved\n:   Holder has 1.5× Defense and Special Defense.",
      "short_effect": "Held: Holder has 1.5× Defense and Special Defense, as long as it’s not fully evolved.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Un étrange concentré d’évolution qui\naugmente la Défense et la Déf. Spé.\nd’un Pokémon pouvant évoluer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious evolutionary lump. When\nheld, it raises the Defense and Sp. Def\nof a Pokémon that can still evolve.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A mysterious evolutionary lump. When\nheld, it raises the Defense and Sp. Def\nof a Pokémon that can still evolve.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "しんかの　ふしぎな　かたまり。\nもたせると　しんかまえ　ポケモンの\nぼうぎょと　とくぼうが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "진화의 이상한 덩어리.\n지니게 하면 진화 전 포켓몬의\n방어와 특수방어가 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un étrange concentré d’évolution qui augmente\nla Défense et la Défense Spéciale d’un Pokémon\npouvant évoluer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mysteriöser Klumpen, der die Verteidigung\nund Spezial-Verteidigung von Pokémon erhöht,\ndie sich noch entwickeln können.",
